\ FE1f's acceptance file (plan row FE1f): a natural term proof.
\ Lean: theorem add_zero' (n : Nat) : n + 0 = n := Eq.refl n
\ Statement and proof are read into Lean's syntax trees and elaborated at
\ end (src/front/elab-decl.fs); the numeral 0 needs instance search (plan
\ FE1e5) and the library's elaboration data: until then the text stops at
\ end, not supported yet (error 139, exit 2). The hand-over to the kernel
\ (FE1f) is tested with a stand-in elaborator in tests/front/handover.fs.
theorem add_zero'
  Nat explicit: n
  n 0 + n =
:=
  n Eq.refl
end add_zero'
